# Local credential drops. This repo is PUBLIC and AGPL-3.0, so an untracked
# credential file here is one `git add -A` away from being published. Ignore
# the shapes local tooling writes rather than relying on nobody typing that.
dev-credentials.json
*credentials*.json
*.pem
*.key

